ws.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-15","zh":"在考慮安進公司（納斯達克股票代碼：AMGN）即將派發 2.52 美元股息之前，請先閱讀此內容"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-13","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/318154/000031815426000010/amgn-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Amgen Inc. (including its subsidiaries, referred to as \"Amgen,\" \"the Company,\" \"we,\" \"our\" or \"us\") discovers, develops, manufactures and delivers innovative medicines to fight some of the world's toughest diseases. We focus on areas of high unmet medical need and leverage our expertise to strive for solutions that dramatically improve people's lives, while also reducing the social and economic burden of disease. We helped launch the biotechnology industry more than 45 years ago and have grown to be one of the world's leading independent biotechnology companies. Our robust pipeline includes potential first-in-class medicines at all stages of development. We have a presence in approximately 100 countries worldwide.","zh":"安進公司（包括其子公司，稱為「安進」、「公司」、「我們」、「我們的」）發現、開發、製造和提供創新藥物，以對抗世界上一些最棘手的疾病。我們專注於醫療需求未被滿足的領域，並利用我們的專業知識來尋求解決方案，以顯著改善人們的生活，同時減少疾病的社會和經濟負擔。 45 多年前，我們幫助開創了生物技術產業，並已發展成為世界領先的獨立生物技術公司之一。我們強大的產品線包括處於各個開發階段的潛在一流藥物。我們的業務遍及全球約 100 個國家。"},{"en":"Following is a summary of significant developments affecting our business that have occurred and that we have reported since the filing of our Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2024.","zh":"以下是自提交截至 2024 年 12 月 31 日的 10-K 表格年度報告以來已發生和報告的影響我們業務的重大進展的摘要。"},{"en":"In August 2025, we announced that the FDA broadened the approved use of Repatha to include adults at increased risk for major adverse cardiovascular events (MACE) due to uncontrolled low-density lipoprotein cholesterol (LDL-C), removing the previous requirement that a patient have been diagnosed with cardiovascular (CV) disease.","zh":"2025 年 8 月，我們宣布 FDA 擴大了 Repatha 的批准用途，將因低密度脂蛋白膽固醇 (LDL-C) 不受控製而導致主要不良心血管事件 (MACE) 風險增加的成年人納入其中，取消了先前對患者已被診斷患有心血管 (CV) 疾病的要求。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our product sales to three large wholesalers, McKesson Corporation, Cencora, Inc. and Cardinal Health, Inc., each individually accounted for more than 10% of total revenues for each of the years 2025, 2024 and 2023. On a combined basis, these wholesalers accounted for 77%, 77% and 79% of worldwide gross revenues for 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively. We monitor the financial condition of our larger customers and limit our credit exposure by setting credit limits and, in certain circumstances, by requiring letters of credit or obtaining credit insurance.","zh":"我們向 McKesson Corporation、Cencora, Inc. 和 Cardinal Health, Inc. 這三家大型批發商的產品銷售量分別佔 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年總收入的 10% 以上。總計而言，這些批發商分別佔 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年全球總收入的 77%、77% 和 79%。我們監控大客戶的財務狀況，並透過設定信用限額以及在某些情況下要求信用證或獲得信用保險來限制我們的信用風險。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a highly competitive environment. A number of our marketed products are indicated for disease areas in which other products or treatments are currently available or are being pursued by our competitors through R&D activities. Additionally, some competitor-marketed products target the same genetic pathways as our recently launched marketed products or product candidates. This competition could impact the pricing and market share of our products. We continue to pursue ways of increasing the value of our medicines through innovations, which can include expanding the disease areas for which our products are indicated and finding new methods to make the delivery or manufacture of our medicines easier and less costly. Such activities can offer important opportunities for differentiation. We plan to continue pursuing innovation efforts to strengthen our competitive position. Such ","zh":"我們在競爭激烈的環境中運作。我們銷售的許多產品適用於目前有其他產品或治療方法的疾病領域，或者我們的競爭對手正在透過研發活動尋求其他產品或治療方法。此外，一些競爭對手銷售的產品與我們最近推出的銷售產品或候選產品具有相同的基因途徑。這種競爭可能會影響我們產品的定價和市場佔有率。我們繼續尋求透過創新來提高藥品價值的方法，其中包括擴大我們產品適用的疾病領域，以及尋找新方法使我們的藥品的交付或製造更容易、成本更低。此類活動可以提供重要的差異化機會。我們計劃繼續努力創新，以增強我們的競爭地位。這樣的"},{"en":"Certain of the existing patents on our principal products have expired, and we face new and increasing competition, including from biosimilars and generics. A biosimilar is another version of a biological product for which marketing approval is sought or has been obtained based on a demonstration that it is \"highly similar\" to the original reference product. We have experienced adverse effects from biosimilar competition on our originator product sales. Companies have launched versions of EPOGEN, NEUPOGEN, Neulasta and ENBREL (Canada only) with U.S. ENBREL biosimilars approved but not launched. Once multiple biosimilar versions of one of our originator products have launched, competition intensifies rapidly, resulting in accelerated net price declines for both the reference and the biosimilar products. For example, our patents for RANKL antibodies, including sequences, for Prolia and XGE","zh":"我們主要產品的某些現有專利已經到期，我們面臨新的、日益激烈的競爭，包括來自生物相似藥和仿製藥的競爭。生物相似藥是生物製品的另一種版本，其上市批准是基於其與原始參考產品「高度相似」的證明而尋求或已獲得的。我們經歷了生物相似藥競爭對我們的原廠產品銷售的不利影響。該公司已推出 EPOGEN、NEUPOGEN、Neulasta 和 ENBREL 版本（僅限加拿大），美國 ENBREL 生物相似藥已獲批准但尚未上市。一旦我們的原創產品的多個生物相似藥版本推出，競爭就會迅速加劇，導致參考產品和生物相似藥產品的淨價格加速下降。例如，我們的 RANKL 抗體專利，包括 Prolia 和 XGE 的序列"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Other Products","val":7263000000,"zh":"其他產品"},{"name":"Prolia","val":4414000000,"zh":"普羅利亞"},{"name":"Repatha","val":3016000000,"zh":"雷帕塔"},{"name":"Otezla","val":2265000000,"zh":"奧特茲拉"},{"name":"Enbrel","val":2226000000,"zh":"恩布雷爾"},{"name":"EVENITY","val":2100000000,"zh":"均勻度"},{"name":"Xgeva","val":2084000000,"zh":"艾克瓦"},{"name":"TEPEZZA","val":1903000000,"zh":"泰佩札"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":1603000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"},{"name":"BLINCYTO","val":1559000000,"zh":"布林賽托"}],"total":36751000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":26419000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":10332000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":36751000000}},"peers":["BIIB","GILD","BMY","MRK","ABT"]}}